{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le09ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Hello Mr. Farmani. I understand you have looked into the issue I brought forward yesterday?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I have. Shocking. I'm outraged. You must believe that this has been all behind my back.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I believe you. Let's speak directly then. We have two general problems and I have a third. However, it may lead to a solution.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I'm listening.", "id": 1, "time": "00100", "image": "engenn8le09ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Miranda?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Firstly, although this wasn't your fault, we have the ethical situation of child labor. Bad business is not illegal in Tindasia. We will not have to worry about criminal charges.", "id": 2, "time": "28000", "image": "engenn8le09ob07re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Never.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: However, it leads to problem number two: bad press. Several concerns are circulating. Workers do not receive enough wages. They have too few benefits. They have little job security.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I have no knowledge of this.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: It's all over social media. We must have no child labor AND we must address some rights for adults. Employ more adults and give them some security. We have a number of suggestions to deal with business and image concerns.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: You mentioned a third problem?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Coincidentally, I have long been familiar with the community of Shalopolis.", "id": 3, "time": "42000", "image": "engenn8le09ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: How so?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: My father funded drinking wells there, and to continue his legacy I have been sponsoring children.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Amazing!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Now you see that I have a vested interest in this community. Mr. Farmani, I believe that you are in a position to bring changes.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: You may soon be known as a human rights advocate, Mr. Farmani.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Hmmm! Well, you're the ones who know how to work with the media.", "id": 4, "time": "83000", "image": "engenn8le09ob07re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le09ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le09ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can manage a delicate meeting with an important client.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can give a presentation.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Who do you think does a good job at handling difficult meetings?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Why do you think so?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts":